🇹🇷 Erdogan continues his crackdown on the opposition in Turkey.

Sinem Dedetaş, the mayor of the Üsküdar district in Istanbul, has been arrested along with her deputy, the mayor's secretary, and several other suspects, reportedly on suspicion of corruption.

